  ('zcrm_1579374000000173811', 'Joan Phelps', 'In-Active', 'zcrm_1579374000000237313', 'Joan Phelps', 'ACA-HES Seminar - Palm Beach Gardens', 'Nancy', 'Shattuck', 'zcrm_1579374000010489003', 'Joan Phelps', 'floridahomesforsaleandrent@hotmail.com', NULL, '561-667-6332', NULL, '561-667-6332', '1963-05-21', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-08-11 16:26:56', '2025-08-08 14:51:39', 'Nancy Shattuck', '137 Harborside Circle', 'Jupiter', 'FL', '33477', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:51:39', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<b>2/12/2015 12:25 PM</b>:  Estimated eligibility results  This household may be eligible for a $355.60 per month premium tax credit to use right away to lower monthly premium costs.  In addition this household may also be eligible for a cost-sharing reduction on a Silver plan that reduces the out-of-pocket expenses paid for deductibles, copayments, and coinsurance.<hr><b>2/10/2015 12:06 PM</b>: Called John. Referred Nancy back to him.<hr><b>2/10/2015 11:57 AM</b>: Called Nancy. She is eligible for a subsidy. Told her John would call her and help her. <hr><b>2/10/2015 11:55 AM</b>: 2.9.15:  Nancy called. Said she has all required info. to move ahead. Please call her.<hr><b>2/4/2015 05:05 PM</b>: Called. L/M to C/B as a f/u to deciding which health coverage to choose.<hr><b>1/23/2015 12:19 PM</b>: Called. Left message to c/b to discuss if she spoke with her accountant re: her income.<hr><b>1/18/2015 07:22 PM</b>: 1.13.15:  Spoke w/Nancy at seminar.She needs to work w/her CPA to calculate income to arrive at best health coverage.  Told her we''d help her compare costs. Needs f/u call.<hr><b>1/14/2015 10:56 AM</b>: This is a test.<hr><b>1/14/2015 10:18 AM</b>: JK - not sure what accountant claimed<hr>', NULL, NULL, '0', '0.0', 'To Be Determined', NULL, NULL, 'ACA-HES Seminar - Palm Beach Gardens', NULL, NULL, 'false', 'fa