  ('zcrm_1579374000000165412', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Enrolled - 2019', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Dr. Lila Rosenthal', 'Alex', 'Kirejczyk', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'alexanderedwardk@gmail.com', NULL, '231-883-3288', NULL, NULL, '1983-10-30', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-08-10 15:35:43', '2025-08-08 14:51:39', 'Alex Kirejczyk', '220 Summit Blvd, Unit 146', 'Broomfield', 'CO', '80021', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:51:39', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '463893073', '<b>5/26/2015 04:32 PM</b>: WS- Asking CO Health Op to fix his start date from 3/1/15 to 4/1/15 as originally intended.  This will bring his balance to current instead of one month behind. Elissa with CO Health Op Services is helping with this.<hr /><b>5/5/2015 02:49 PM</b>: WS- Spoke with Alex just now and he has paid his bills.  His account is current with CO Health Op.  He thanks me immensely because CO Health Op is working out very well so far!<hr /><b>4/30/2015 11:25 AM</b>: WS- Can''t leave vm bc it''s not set up yet. Sent email bc his CO Health Op account is past due.  I don''t think he''s paid once yet. Grrrr...<hr /><b>2/26/2015 03:22 PM</b>: WS- If I find a good dental or vision plan send it his way.<hr /><b>2/26/2015 03:20 PM</b>: WS- Works at Land Rover Flatirons in Superior, CO, 303-554-3022.<hr /><b>2/23/2015 03:27 PM</b>: WS- Will NOT be accepted by LHS bc has type 1 diabetes.<hr /><b>2/19/2015 05:33 PM</b>: WS- Needs health care coverage asap to get his insulin that he needs.<hr />', 'CO Health OP', 'CO Health Op Bison Silver PPO', '260.05', '50.0', 'Health Insurance', NULL, '2015-04-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, '21.84', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '10.92', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL