ing Dr. Gilly Perez''s office. Nobody is answering. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/21/2015 02:47 PM</B>: WS- Dr. Francisco''s office I spoke with Merium and she said they will accept it. Sometimes if not familiar with coverage they will ask patient to pay upfront and then reimburse patient after they get paid. Might be fine since patient has to pay 1st $500 anyhow. But, coding should indicate coverage is good and capture discounted rates. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/21/2015 02:32 PM</B>: WS- On hold with Dr. Francisco''s office now. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/21/2015 02:32 PM</B>: WS- Dr. Gilly office only opened ''til 1:00 EST on Wed. Try again tomorrow. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/20/2015 03:33 PM</B>: WS- Nice and will call me back shortly. Wants to talk! <br /><HR><br /><B>1/13/2015 01:04 PM</B>: WS- Left vm again and asked to call me back either way. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/8/2015 11:26 AM</B>: WS- Left vm. <br /><HR>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Import', NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Contacts_2025_10_16.csv;Contacts_2026_03_20.csv'),
