  ('zcrm_1579374000000165385', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Future Prospect', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'C4HCO site  Knows a Scipione (Scippy) in MN so she chose me. :-)', 'Elizabeth', 'Garbow', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Betsygarbow@gmail.com', NULL, '(612)590-3281', NULL, NULL, '1951-11-05', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-08-10 15:35:43', '2025-08-08 14:51:37', 'Elizabeth Garbow', '267 south Taft Court', 'Louisville', 'CO', '80027', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:51:37', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<b>3/03/2015 12:54 PM</b>: <B>1/22/2015 02:03 PM</B>: WS- Enrollment complete and should show the correct 1/1 start date after 3:00 pm tomorrow.<br /><HR><br /><B>1/22/2015 02:02 PM</B>: WS- Betsy set up auto-pay back in Dec. with CO Health Op. Asked her to check to see if they charged her or not. If not, she will call them to get it going. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/22/2015 11:42 AM</B>: WS- Jennifer is completing her enrollment right now. IE 11 not working on some systems. <br /><HR><br /><B>1/6/2015 04:33 PM</B>: WS- Betsy followed up and they still found the old/wrong Kaiser enrollment in the system blocking the enrollment she wants. They supposedly elimiinated that again and they can see the CO Health Op enrollment is still an open ticket. They told her it may take a few weeks to complete the process. I included her enrollment in an email to Patti Meyers to help push through the Escalations/or some team to get these done asap! <br /><HR><br /><B>1/6/2015 03:14 PM</B>: WS- Dec. 24th $80.79 for CO Health Op. Will call CO Health Op to ask for temp card and will let me know. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/31/2014 04:23 PM</B>: Tried to enroll and system can''t verify her info. still. Still waiting for C4HCO and PEAK to enroll her manually. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/29/2014 10:09 AM</B>: Incident # to cancel Kaiser Plan on the Betsy Garbow Offline Account with Steven Adams account- 141229-000682. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/29/2014 10:07 AM</B>: Accurate $385.63 APTC and 87% CSR. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/29/2014 10:06 AM</B>: Submitted to Peak team b/c account is still open so they can manually enrolled. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/29/2014 10:05 AM</B>: Duplcate account under Betsy Garbow showing a plan enrolled in and wrong plan with Steven Adams as broker for Offline account. Jennifer (Supervisor) is going to cancel that plan. The correct plan has been submitted by Joe with C4HCO according to her request of new CO Health Op plan. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/13/2014 10:57 PM</B>: WS- Note from Elizabeth (Betsy)- I was able to get through on the phone number listed for Connect for Health after being on hold for an hour. A very nice man helped me pick a plan and he got me enrolled. He was also unable to get through on the website, but was able to get around the issue by having his supervisor okay my enrollment. I chose Colorado Health Epo Select with a $3900 annual deductible at a monthly cost of $80.79 after my tax credit. It was a lot of work, but I am relieved to have it taken care of. Thanks for your explanation of my choices. I was able to use that information to pick a plan that will work for me. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/11/2014 12:38 PM</B>: Entered her new Case ID # and Auth # but Medicaid''s system can''t recognize her information. So, gave her the # to try to call tomorrow. UGH! <br /><HR><br /><B>12/11/2014 12:29 PM</B>: Auth #351971950 <br /><HR><br /><B>12/11/2014 12:18 PM</B>: Case # 1B992S8 and tracking # 8012838088 and looking for auth # now. <br /><HR><br /><B>12/1/2014 02:25 PM</B>: She is going to update her Medicaid app. to show about $17-$18K in income. Doesn''t want to be on Medicaid. Will call me when/if she''s able to change it. She already submitted it but was only showing $13,780 in income. <br /><HR><hr />', 'CO Health OP', 'Col